title: 'Which machine? I recommend a Hetzner CPX32 in Helsinki: 4 vCPU, 8 GB, 160 GB of disk, about $34 a month, tried for a month first.'
pid: cf4ff319-1a2f-4a07-a5b8-e7d8d0a8d307
body: |2-
  It is billed by the hour, so a trial that disappoints costs little. Its
  cores are AMD server cores shared with other customers, and a month
  would show their speed. Helsinki is half the price of Hetzner's US
  sites, and distance matters little if your editor stays here (the
  next note). To choose another, name it under this; the prices are
  below.
  If you do not answer but say "rent", this is the one you would be
  asked to sign up for.
